    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1342">

                <pb facs="0903" n="787" xml:id="pg787"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/106.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Consul Letcher.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 8, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Investigate and report as to responsibility for killing of two Spanish subjects
                    whose bodies were recently found in or near Chihuahua, and also as to action, if
                    any, taken by authorities to ascertain responsibility and punish guilty
                    persons.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
